<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13722" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπο-σκοπέω</span></b> , (with fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-σκέψομαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>look away from</i> other objects <i>at</i> one, and
			so <i>look steadily,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τινα</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				746
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				291e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1284b5
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴς τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					1195
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόρρω ποι ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					432e
				</span></i>
			; <i>keep watch,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DMar.</u>
				6.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c.acc.,
				<i>look to, regard,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hec.</u>
				939
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				6.72
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Procop.
				<u>Goth.</u>
				4.15
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποσκοπεῖσθαι τὸ μέλλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Pomp.</u>
					79
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procl.
					<u>in Prm.</u>
					p.549
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποσκοπεῖν εἰ . . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					236
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ πόλις ἐκ περιωπῆς -εῖται</span>”
				<i>is visible from a distance,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procop.
					<u>Aed.</u>
					1.1
				</span></i>
			.</div>
